WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 4

02:21.900 --> 02:23.280
Close the door.

03:04.290 --> 03:05.920
Give out my order.

03:06.290 --> 03:07.540
Tell them to clean up

03:07.540 --> 03:08.680
the servants' kitchen,

03:08.700 --> 03:10.800
for Fan Xian to move in.

03:10.820 --> 03:12.120
Yes.

03:17.980 --> 03:18.910
Madam.

03:18.930 --> 03:20.250
Still inside?

03:20.340 --> 03:21.160
Yes.

03:21.180 --> 03:23.690
There's no sound. It's very quiet.

03:28.060 --> 03:31.640
Sizhe! Sizhe!

03:32.090 --> 03:33.370
Wake up!

03:33.980 --> 03:35.800
Mom, ten taels of silver will be enough!

03:35.820 --> 03:37.090
You...

03:38.010 --> 03:40.350
It's improper for me to go.

03:40.370 --> 03:42.960
Just go to your father's study.

03:42.980 --> 03:44.060
Say that

03:44.060 --> 03:45.780
you're worried that he might be hungry.

03:45.780 --> 03:47.920
Ask him if he wants any pastries.

03:48.180 --> 03:49.070
Take the chance to see

03:49.090 --> 03:50.710
what Fan Xian is doing

03:50.730 --> 03:52.280
in the study.

03:55.450 --> 03:57.680
Mother, you're right.

03:57.700 --> 04:00.330
I'll do as you command.

04:02.540 --> 04:04.320
Take Young Master there.

04:04.340 --> 04:05.640
Yes.

04:16.890 --> 04:18.870
So obedient.

04:18.890 --> 04:21.370
He's finally made some progress.

04:21.700 --> 04:23.120
Lead the way faster!

04:23.140 --> 04:23.890
Yes!

04:23.890 --> 04:26.240
It's so late, but my dad hasn't eaten anything yet.

04:26.260 --> 04:28.850
I'm so worried!

04:29.930 --> 04:31.310
Really worried!

04:31.330 --> 04:32.680
Young Master?

04:32.700 --> 04:34.020
Am I silly?

04:34.020 --> 04:35.250
Young Master!

04:35.890 --> 04:37.970
Madam, Young Master has run away.

05:06.160 --> 05:07.480
Fan Jian, Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue & Earl Sinan

05:07.490 --> 05:08.920
Feeling anxious after waiting so long?

05:10.770 --> 05:13.600
Father, good evening!

05:16.460 --> 05:18.810
To answer your question, I'm not anxious.

05:20.370 --> 05:22.030
After waiting in Danzhou for so many years,

05:22.050 --> 05:23.640
no need to be anxious for a little longer.

05:25.770 --> 05:28.010
It sounds like a complaint.

05:28.170 --> 05:30.400
Should I shed tears

05:30.420 --> 05:32.240
and cry for an hour with you in my arms

05:32.260 --> 05:33.050
to express

05:33.050 --> 05:34.260
my regret?

05:34.260 --> 05:34.860
Please don't!

05:34.860 --> 05:36.290
I think so, too.

05:38.020 --> 05:39.690
Then let's get down to business.

05:40.930 --> 05:43.250
What kind of person do you want to become?

05:44.860 --> 05:47.630
I want to become the richest man in the world,

05:47.650 --> 05:49.920
living a peaceful and romantic life
with many young and beautiful wives.

05:50.330 --> 05:52.140
Sorry, I'm a vulgar man.

05:52.140 --> 05:53.630
How will you build up a fortune?

05:53.650 --> 05:55.440
I've already thought about that!

05:55.890 --> 05:57.680
I have a unique technique.

05:57.700 --> 05:59.140
Under high temperatures,

05:59.140 --> 06:01.490
I can make something marvelous out of sands

06:01.490 --> 06:03.750
which is much smoother and
more transparent than the crystal.

06:03.770 --> 06:05.000
I call it glass.

06:05.020 --> 06:06.760
Once it is made...

06:12.420 --> 06:13.750
Where did you get that?

06:13.770 --> 06:15.820
Your mom made it before.

06:15.820 --> 06:19.040
And the technique is mature.

06:22.050 --> 06:24.320
Never mind. I've got something else.

06:24.420 --> 06:25.520
I can use grease

06:25.540 --> 06:26.770
to produce something special

06:26.770 --> 06:27.930
which can clean both clothes and human body.

06:27.930 --> 06:29.300
Smooth as grease

06:29.300 --> 06:30.310
with fragrance,

06:30.330 --> 06:32.260
it's far better than honey locust and wood ash.

06:32.260 --> 06:34.130
I call it soap.

06:42.700 --> 06:44.910
Your mom made that before.

06:44.930 --> 06:46.400
She not only made soap,

06:46.420 --> 06:48.010
but also perfumed soap.

06:48.540 --> 06:49.420
That's fine.

06:49.420 --> 06:51.030
Actually, I've got something else.

06:51.050 --> 06:51.890
Nowadays,

06:51.890 --> 06:52.750
besides honey,

06:52.770 --> 06:53.680
sweet food are usually made of

06:53.700 --> 06:54.840
maltose or malt.

06:54.860 --> 06:56.520
Even saccharose is pretty rough.

06:56.540 --> 06:57.280
I've got a technique

06:57.300 --> 06:58.960
to further refine the saccharose into

06:58.980 --> 07:00.540
granulated sugar as white as snow.

07:00.540 --> 07:01.720
And the flavor is excellent.

07:01.740 --> 07:03.030
White granulated sugar.

07:03.050 --> 07:05.320
There are two full jars in the kitchen.

07:06.490 --> 07:08.310
Also made by my mom?

07:08.330 --> 07:11.020
Yes, your mom made it back then.

07:11.020 --> 07:11.930
Why haven't I seen these things

07:11.930 --> 07:13.050
in Danzhou?

07:13.050 --> 07:14.560
They are only used by

07:14.580 --> 07:15.960
influential officials

07:15.980 --> 07:18.970
and circulated in big cities.

07:19.610 --> 07:20.740
So I'm to blame

07:20.740 --> 07:22.130
for living in the rural area.

07:22.540 --> 07:24.600
Do you have any other ideas?

07:31.300 --> 07:32.600
No.

07:33.770 --> 07:36.440
Why is my mom always one step ahead of me?!

07:38.540 --> 07:39.960
Your mom ran a firm,

07:39.980 --> 07:42.120
so she had countless fancy ideas.

07:42.140 --> 07:44.310
Back then, the scale of her firm

07:44.330 --> 07:45.590
was already No.1

07:45.610 --> 07:48.160
in the world.

07:48.210 --> 07:50.800
It was the fortune center of the world.

07:50.820 --> 07:52.160
I've heard about that.

07:52.260 --> 07:53.720
Rumor has it that after she died,

07:53.740 --> 07:54.890
the firm was registered under the state treasury.

07:54.890 --> 07:56.560
That's not true.

07:56.580 --> 07:58.310
It was controlled by the imperial family

07:58.330 --> 08:00.480
and was named Neiku
(Homophone for underwear in Chinese).

08:02.460 --> 08:04.190
Who came up with such a vulgar name?

08:04.210 --> 08:05.600
Mind your words!

08:06.210 --> 08:08.850
It was named by His Majesty.

08:10.490 --> 08:13.810
What's so vulgar?

08:14.540 --> 08:17.480
Never mind. Go on.

08:18.090 --> 08:20.580
Diligent in handling complicated national affairs,

08:20.580 --> 08:22.460
His Majesty has no energy

08:22.460 --> 08:24.280
to manage Neiku in person.

08:24.300 --> 08:25.600
Therefore,

08:25.770 --> 08:27.560
he put Li Yunrui, the Princess Royal,

08:27.580 --> 08:30.130
in charge.

08:31.490 --> 08:33.690
The Princess Royal is in charge of Neiku?

08:41.780 --> 08:44.440
She's extremely beautiful

08:44.460 --> 08:46.320
and very gentle.

08:46.340 --> 08:48.720
Though she's not related to His Majesty by blood,

08:48.780 --> 08:50.470
she's deeply trusted.

08:50.490 --> 08:54.280
And she's not married yet.

08:54.680 --> 08:57.670
Li Yunrui, the Princess Royal of Nanqing

09:14.170 --> 09:15.600
Father,

09:16.140 --> 09:18.350
are you into her?

09:18.370 --> 09:19.880
Nonsense!

09:19.900 --> 09:21.150
Since we met,

09:21.170 --> 09:23.350
you've talked from the firm to the Princess Royal.

09:23.370 --> 09:24.780
You said we would talk about business,

09:24.780 --> 09:26.920
but you only talked about gossips.

09:27.410 --> 09:29.240
Do you know what gossip means?

09:29.260 --> 09:30.440
The Princess Royal

09:30.460 --> 09:33.350
has a daughter with Lin Ruofu,

09:33.370 --> 09:35.200
the current Prime Minister.

09:35.220 --> 09:36.680
You just said

09:36.700 --> 09:37.850
she's not married yet.

09:37.850 --> 09:40.520
It's a big secret.

09:40.660 --> 09:42.690
You're definitely gossiping!

09:43.410 --> 09:45.120
The Princess Royal's daughter

09:45.140 --> 09:47.520
is named Lin Wan'er.

09:47.730 --> 09:49.470
She is the woman

09:49.490 --> 09:51.200
you come to marry.

09:51.220 --> 09:53.330
Bastard son and bastard daughter,

09:54.460 --> 09:56.160
we're really made for each other.

09:56.290 --> 09:58.010
His Majesty proclaimed that

09:59.290 --> 10:01.480
whoever marries Lin Wan'er

10:01.820 --> 10:03.200
can take over

10:03.220 --> 10:05.470
Neiku

10:05.490 --> 10:06.970
from Li Yunrui,

10:06.970 --> 10:08.960
the Princess Royal.

10:09.460 --> 10:11.140
Chen Pingping and Fei Jie

10:11.140 --> 10:13.150
don't want you to come to the capital now.

10:13.170 --> 10:14.680
I take you here

10:14.700 --> 10:16.400
while they are away.

10:16.900 --> 10:18.120
Because now

10:18.140 --> 10:19.530
is the best chance to get back

10:19.530 --> 10:20.680
your mom's properties

10:20.700 --> 10:21.410
and reclaim

10:21.410 --> 10:23.840
what should be yours in the first place.

10:25.170 --> 10:26.250
Here!

10:39.490 --> 10:41.160
This is for you.

10:41.780 --> 10:42.760
What's this?

10:42.780 --> 10:45.150
The summary of important things of Neiku over the years.

10:45.170 --> 10:46.390
Read it carefully.

10:46.410 --> 10:47.970
It's helpful for you to reclaim the properties.

10:47.970 --> 10:48.530
Actually, I...

10:48.530 --> 10:50.260
But you should be more careful.

10:50.260 --> 10:52.830
Neiku is a money tree for the imperial family.

10:52.850 --> 10:55.720
A lot of people don't want you to take over.

10:56.490 --> 10:59.400
My greetings to you, Your Majesty!

11:00.700 --> 11:01.710
Arise.

11:01.730 --> 11:03.600
Thank you, Your Majesty!

11:04.610 --> 11:07.640
It's late. What brings you here?
=Empress Dowager of Nanqing=

11:07.660 --> 11:08.920
Your Majesty!

11:09.900 --> 11:11.650
Fan Xian has arrived in the capital.

11:11.700 --> 11:15.370
It's the kid Earl Sinan

11:15.370 --> 11:16.890
kept in Danzhou.

11:18.970 --> 11:20.690
Wan'er was sent out of the palace

11:20.850 --> 11:22.720
right after I gave birth to her.

11:23.340 --> 11:25.400
I've always felt guilty

11:25.730 --> 11:27.840
and wanted to find her a good husband.

11:28.020 --> 11:29.920
But Fan Xian is a bumpkin from a remote place

11:30.170 --> 11:32.450
with no fame or talent.

11:32.490 --> 11:34.240
He's no match for Wan'er!

11:34.260 --> 11:36.160
So, you...

11:36.370 --> 11:38.120
I don't want Wan'er to marry him.

11:38.140 --> 11:40.570
So the Princess Royal doesn't like the marriage.

11:40.700 --> 11:41.760
That's right.

11:41.780 --> 11:43.470
She's not happy with it from the start.

11:43.490 --> 11:44.680
Then it's over.

11:44.700 --> 11:46.020
Without the consent of the mother-in-law,

11:46.020 --> 11:46.970
there will be no marriage.

11:46.970 --> 11:48.760
She has no say

11:48.780 --> 11:50.030
in your marriage with Lin Wan'er.

11:50.050 --> 11:51.140
She's her mom, yet she has no say in this?

11:51.140 --> 11:52.470
For the imperial family,

11:52.490 --> 11:54.350
family affection is never the theme.

11:54.370 --> 11:58.160
You want to stop Fan Xian from marrying Wan'er?

12:00.220 --> 12:01.960
Your Majesty, I beg your support!

12:09.240 --> 12:11.470
Hong Sixiang, Head of Eunuchs of Nanqing

12:17.370 --> 12:19.250
Princess Royal.

12:21.700 --> 12:23.130
Eunuch Hong,

12:23.170 --> 12:24.810
I'm sorry.

12:38.290 --> 12:39.590
When it comes to the imperial family,

12:39.610 --> 12:42.910
only His Majesty can make the call.

12:42.930 --> 12:47.250
No one cares if you like it or not.

12:47.580 --> 12:50.030
That is a warning for you

12:50.050 --> 12:52.840
to never cross the line.

12:55.700 --> 12:57.210
Yes.

13:00.530 --> 13:01.900
As long as His Majesty consents,

13:01.900 --> 13:03.580
what others think

13:03.580 --> 13:04.950
doesn't matter.

13:04.970 --> 13:06.020
But why does His Majesty

13:06.020 --> 13:06.780
have to make me

13:06.780 --> 13:07.910
marry Lin Wan'er?

13:07.930 --> 13:09.950
His Majesty has four sons.

13:09.970 --> 13:11.460
The eldest one is away leading troops.

13:11.460 --> 13:13.350
The youngest one is still a child.

13:13.370 --> 13:16.080
Now the Crown Prince and the second prince

13:16.290 --> 13:18.830
are fighting for the throne.

13:18.850 --> 13:20.510
How is that relevant to me?

13:20.530 --> 13:23.050
The Princess Royal has supported

13:23.050 --> 13:25.010
the Crown Prince all along.

13:26.050 --> 13:27.520
It's like the imperial wealth

13:27.580 --> 13:29.250
is controlled by the Crown Prince.

13:29.340 --> 13:30.770
It's way too dangerous.

13:30.970 --> 13:33.020
So the Head of Neiku must be replaced.

13:33.020 --> 13:34.320
Exactly.

13:34.340 --> 13:36.250
By taking over Neiku,

13:36.490 --> 13:38.520
I practically shake the foundation of the Crown Prince.

13:38.930 --> 13:40.920
This might be the cause of

13:41.020 --> 13:43.270
the assassination in Danzhou,

13:43.290 --> 13:44.590
You mean

13:44.610 --> 13:46.830
it's the Crown Prince and his followers who tried to kill me.

13:46.850 --> 13:50.130
It's probable with interests concerned.

13:52.410 --> 13:53.680
You've said all these

13:53.700 --> 13:55.350
to clear

13:55.370 --> 13:57.250
Liu Ruyu.

13:57.780 --> 13:58.730
You don't believe me?

13:58.730 --> 14:00.680
You even drag the Crown Prince into this.

14:00.700 --> 14:02.280
Does it matter if I believe you or not?

14:05.730 --> 14:07.130
Follow me.

14:21.140 --> 14:22.520
Princess Royal.

14:23.220 --> 14:24.470
His Majesty wants to see you.

14:24.490 --> 14:27.250
Please come with me.

14:27.850 --> 14:29.520
Just lead the way.

14:45.080 --> 14:47.470
Fan Ruoruo, daughter of Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian

14:51.080 --> 14:53.350
Fan Sizhe, second son of Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian

14:53.820 --> 14:55.160
I'm hungry.

15:01.820 --> 15:03.880
Finished talking? Go ahead and take a seat.

15:03.900 --> 15:04.800
I have to say this.

15:04.820 --> 15:05.460
You don't want to eat,

15:05.460 --> 15:07.370
but Fan Xian can be hungry.

15:19.280 --> 15:21.150
Fan Xian, bastard son of Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian

15:21.440 --> 15:22.480
We have important things to discuss. Please leave us.
=Liu Ruyu, Fan Xian's stepmother=

15:22.480 --> 15:22.840
We have important things to discuss. Please leave us.

15:22.840 --> 15:23.760
We have important things to discuss. Please leave us.
=Fan Jian, Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue & Earl Sinan=

15:23.760 --> 15:24.840
We have important things to discuss. Please leave us.

15:32.220 --> 15:33.480
Yes.

15:35.260 --> 15:36.840
Only me?

15:47.730 --> 15:48.820
Get out now!

15:48.820 --> 15:50.160
Yes!

15:52.530 --> 15:54.040
Did you send

15:54.730 --> 15:57.160
Butler Zhou to Danzhou?

15:59.260 --> 16:01.080
Master, you've known that.

16:01.900 --> 16:03.760
Danzhou is so faraway.

16:03.780 --> 16:05.000
I thought

16:05.020 --> 16:06.820
it would be reassuring to send someone trustworthy

16:06.820 --> 16:08.150
to take care of Xian'er.

16:08.170 --> 16:10.080
He tried to assassinate Fan Xian

16:10.100 --> 16:12.280
in Danzhou.

16:13.370 --> 16:15.050
A... assassinate?!

16:15.050 --> 16:16.370
You don't know that?

16:16.530 --> 16:18.760
I haven't heard from him this month.

16:18.780 --> 16:19.680
I've no idea.

16:19.700 --> 16:21.210
There won't be any letters.

16:21.530 --> 16:23.460
My mother has sent him onto a fish boat.

16:23.460 --> 16:25.960
He won't get down in recent years.

16:28.370 --> 16:30.400
Staying away for all these years,

16:30.820 --> 16:33.400
he actually dare betray his master.

16:34.220 --> 16:36.450
Thank God Xian'er is all right.

16:37.780 --> 16:40.080
Butler Zhou confessed it all.

16:40.290 --> 16:42.810
He had received your secret letter,

16:43.170 --> 16:45.880
asking him to kill Fan Xian

16:45.900 --> 16:48.480
with the Investigator's Office.

16:48.780 --> 16:50.000
How come the Investigator's Office is also involved?

16:50.020 --> 16:53.240
They also received a fake order.

16:53.260 --> 16:55.640
The Investigator's Office only answers to His Majesty.

16:55.660 --> 16:58.120
Whoever can insert spies in the Investigator's Office

16:58.140 --> 17:00.270
must be from the imperial family.

17:00.290 --> 17:03.650
And Lady Yi, mother of the youngest prince,

17:05.340 --> 17:07.250
happens to be your cousin.

17:07.620 --> 17:08.980
Master, you mean

17:08.980 --> 17:10.230
I am the one who wants to kill Fan Xian?

17:10.250 --> 17:11.270
Aren't you?

17:11.290 --> 17:12.130
No, it's not me.

17:12.130 --> 17:13.220
Why not?

17:13.220 --> 17:14.080
I...

17:14.100 --> 17:15.440
Tell him.

17:23.700 --> 17:24.990
If I want to kill you,

17:25.010 --> 17:25.930
I'll definitely

17:25.930 --> 17:26.820
find a stranger

17:26.820 --> 17:27.800
to do the job.

17:27.820 --> 17:29.960
I'll never ask Butler Zhou to do it.

17:29.980 --> 17:31.680
I... I'm not that stupid.

17:31.700 --> 17:33.200
Maybe you did it the opposite way.

17:33.220 --> 17:34.580
I have no reason to kill you.

17:34.580 --> 17:35.990
You don't want me to inherit the family properties.

17:36.010 --> 17:37.130
No, Fan Xian.

17:37.130 --> 17:38.340
I might be particular about you,

17:38.340 --> 17:39.580
and I might try to suppress you,

17:39.580 --> 17:40.820
but I'll never try to kill you.

17:40.820 --> 17:41.480
Why?

17:41.500 --> 17:42.890
If you die because of me,

17:42.890 --> 17:44.500
Master is sure to

17:44.500 --> 17:46.600
drive Sizhe and me out of the Fan mansion.

17:47.860 --> 17:48.800
I...

17:48.820 --> 17:50.170
This...

17:50.820 --> 17:51.410
Ruoruo.

17:51.410 --> 17:53.080
I think she's made a point.

17:53.410 --> 17:55.600
If she wanted to kill you,

17:55.700 --> 17:57.600
she wouldn't involve her minion.

17:57.930 --> 17:59.250
Right.

18:02.340 --> 18:03.560
So?

18:04.100 --> 18:04.980
Words alone

18:04.980 --> 18:06.360
can't prove anything.

18:06.380 --> 18:07.600
I...

18:08.100 --> 18:09.960
You can investigate on your own.

18:10.410 --> 18:12.010
Let's eat first.

18:16.930 --> 18:18.720
Here you are!

18:31.890 --> 18:33.800
It's from the Princess Royal.

18:44.680 --> 18:47.430
Li Yunrui, the Princess Royal of Nanqing

19:12.170 --> 19:14.460
Your Majesty, the Princess Royal is here.

19:14.480 --> 19:16.790
Emperor Qing, Nanqing's emperor

19:31.290 --> 19:33.410
Don't hold a grudge against the Empress Dowager

19:33.500 --> 19:35.080
for that slap on your face.

19:37.820 --> 19:38.860
I just don't want Wan'er

19:38.860 --> 19:41.010
to marry a bumpkin.

19:41.410 --> 19:43.360
You can just say it out!

19:43.380 --> 19:44.380
Why ruin

19:44.380 --> 19:47.170
other's reputation instead?

19:48.170 --> 19:50.080
Your Majesty, what do you mean?

19:50.650 --> 19:52.250
I don't understand.

19:52.500 --> 19:53.930
Really?

19:55.500 --> 19:56.680
Gong Dian!

19:58.340 --> 19:59.200
Yes!
=Gong Dian, Deputy Director of Imperial Guards of Nanqing=

19:59.220 --> 20:00.480
Go find out

20:00.820 --> 20:02.510
who sent the maidservants

20:02.530 --> 20:04.440
out for purchasing today.

20:04.770 --> 20:06.200
Yes, Your Majesty!

20:23.460 --> 20:24.890
Take a seat.

20:32.530 --> 20:34.480
Come on! Let's eat while the dishes are still hot.

20:34.890 --> 20:35.290
Eat more.

20:35.290 --> 20:36.230
What a feast!

20:36.250 --> 20:37.990
Here, I'll fetch you some soup.

20:38.010 --> 20:38.960
OK.

20:38.980 --> 20:39.500
You're so kind!

20:39.500 --> 20:41.200
This is the white gourd clam soup.

20:41.220 --> 20:41.960
I especially

20:41.980 --> 20:43.560
have the clams delivered.

20:43.580 --> 20:45.440
Here! Have a try!

20:45.650 --> 20:46.620
Thank you so much!

20:46.620 --> 20:47.770
Madam, I've never seen such a dish

20:47.770 --> 20:49.110
in Danzhou.

20:49.130 --> 20:50.080
Really?

20:50.100 --> 20:50.930
- Just try it! - How does it taste?

20:50.930 --> 20:51.960
Do you like it?

20:51.980 --> 20:53.480
I'm so blessed!

20:53.700 --> 20:54.890
- Good! - Terrific!

20:54.890 --> 20:56.320
Madam! Father!

20:56.340 --> 20:57.860
This fish is specially brought here

20:57.860 --> 20:58.460
from Danzhou.

20:58.460 --> 20:59.650
Please try and see how you like it.

20:59.650 --> 21:01.010
OK! Let's taste it!

21:01.050 --> 21:03.680
It looks so yummy. You're so thoughtful.

21:03.700 --> 21:04.870
If you like it,

21:04.890 --> 21:06.870
I'll send you fish regularly from home.

21:06.890 --> 21:08.290
I like it very much. It also smells good.

21:08.290 --> 21:09.680
I'm glad you like it.

21:10.700 --> 21:12.250
Master, eat more.

21:12.530 --> 21:12.930
Here!

21:12.930 --> 21:13.630
Madam!

21:13.650 --> 21:15.390
Did you make all the dishes?

21:15.410 --> 21:16.050
Yes, I did.

21:16.050 --> 21:17.910
My dad is so lucky!

21:17.930 --> 21:19.380
I specially made them for you.

21:19.380 --> 21:20.770
Lucky me!

21:21.860 --> 21:23.500
I'd like to learn a few dishes from you in future

21:23.500 --> 21:24.580
so that I can cook for you. Is that OK?

21:24.580 --> 21:25.560
No problem!

21:25.580 --> 21:26.930
Let me see what I want to learn.

21:26.930 --> 21:27.930
Come on! Try more!

21:27.930 --> 21:28.680
Sister.

21:28.700 --> 21:29.320
Here!

21:29.340 --> 21:31.270
I've only been out for a little while.

21:31.290 --> 21:32.560
How come

21:32.580 --> 21:34.250
they suddenly become so close?

21:34.700 --> 21:35.720
It's nothing.

21:35.740 --> 21:37.130
They just suspect that your mom

21:37.130 --> 21:38.370
tried to kill elder brother.

21:39.130 --> 21:40.250
Come on! Try this!

21:40.250 --> 21:40.650
This!

21:40.650 --> 21:41.340
Let me get it for you.

21:41.340 --> 21:42.420
It's delicious.

21:42.530 --> 21:44.480
Sister, don't you lie to me!

21:44.500 --> 21:45.700
It's the truth.

21:45.700 --> 21:47.410
Eat with me! I can help myself!

21:55.340 --> 21:56.870
I'm just happy watching you eat.

21:56.890 --> 21:58.250
Then I'll eat more.

22:04.650 --> 22:05.600
Here! Here! Here!

22:05.620 --> 22:06.770
Come on! Eat!

22:06.770 --> 22:08.010
OK!

22:15.860 --> 22:16.910
Your Majesty,

22:16.930 --> 22:18.770
Ms. Han from Shanggong Bureau

22:18.770 --> 22:20.960
is the one who arranged for today's purchase.

22:20.980 --> 22:22.170
Where is she?

22:22.620 --> 22:25.410
Your Majesty, she has

22:26.010 --> 22:27.440
hung herself.

22:47.220 --> 22:49.580
Your Majesty, do you need me to explain

22:49.580 --> 22:51.720
my relationship with that Ms. Han?

22:52.050 --> 22:54.390
No need to make it so clear.

22:54.410 --> 22:56.170
If Your Majesty ask,

22:56.410 --> 22:57.560
I'll answer.

22:57.580 --> 22:58.870
Are you tired?

22:58.890 --> 23:00.560
Resting in the imperial palace all the time,

23:00.580 --> 23:02.030
I don't feel tired.

23:02.050 --> 23:03.250
Good!

23:03.250 --> 23:05.010
Then just sit here and wait!

23:24.820 --> 23:26.410
Your Majesty,

23:26.700 --> 23:28.680
what are we waiting for?

23:28.700 --> 23:30.010
A man.

23:31.980 --> 23:33.720
May I ask who he is?

23:33.740 --> 23:35.030
If it's a court official,

23:35.050 --> 23:36.360
then I'd better excuse myself.

23:36.380 --> 23:38.050
You'll know who he is

23:38.100 --> 23:40.050
when he arrives.

23:42.460 --> 23:44.500
Your Majesty, His Highness requests to see you.

23:44.500 --> 23:45.960
Let him in.

23:46.130 --> 23:48.130
Look, here he is.

24:04.220 --> 24:06.930
Don't just kneel. Say something.

24:09.700 --> 24:10.980
It was me who planned

24:10.980 --> 24:12.680
the whole maidservants blocking the carriage thing.

24:12.770 --> 24:14.230
I'm willing to take punishments.

24:14.250 --> 24:16.200
I'm really disappointed at you.

24:17.080 --> 24:17.620
Li Chengqian, the Crown Prince of Nanqing

24:17.620 --> 24:18.600
I acknowledge my sin.

24:18.620 --> 24:21.530
Li Yunrui didn't acknowledge anything.

24:28.290 --> 24:29.700
I made the mistake

24:29.700 --> 24:31.150
out of temporary confusion.

24:31.170 --> 24:33.410
Reconsidering it now, I feel so ashamed.

24:33.650 --> 24:34.990
Neiku should be managed

24:35.010 --> 24:37.750
by the person pointed by Your Majesty.

24:37.770 --> 24:39.630
I should never act as I think fit.

24:39.650 --> 24:42.960
By taking charge of Neiku,
one can gather the wealth of the world.

24:42.980 --> 24:45.390
As the Crown Prince,

24:45.410 --> 24:48.010
you sure have to fight for it.

24:52.100 --> 24:54.290
What really disappointed me

24:54.860 --> 24:57.410
is the means you've adopted.

25:02.100 --> 25:03.680
Let me ask you.

25:03.930 --> 25:05.440
Is there any difference

25:05.460 --> 25:06.620
between an imperial blood

25:06.620 --> 25:08.290
and a street civilian?

25:09.650 --> 25:11.990
As different as heaven and earth.

25:12.010 --> 25:13.650
But some may say

25:14.340 --> 25:18.150
they are both

25:18.170 --> 25:21.050
ordinary people

25:21.380 --> 25:23.720
with two hands and two eyes.

25:24.250 --> 25:26.990
Your Majesty, that's insane.

25:27.010 --> 25:29.360
What are complicated ethic codes

25:29.380 --> 25:31.130
and strict laws for?

25:33.980 --> 25:36.110
For protecting the foundation of the country.

25:36.130 --> 25:37.930
Protecting the foundation of the country?

25:38.700 --> 25:41.480
It's for building a high tower

25:41.500 --> 25:42.890
in people's heart,

25:42.890 --> 25:46.750
so that we can stand high above
the masses with dignity and respect.

25:46.770 --> 25:49.630
Whoever said that should be executed.

25:49.650 --> 25:50.750
Trying to ruin other's name

25:50.770 --> 25:52.800
at the cost of the imperial name,

25:53.700 --> 25:56.320
we've become a joke.

25:56.890 --> 26:00.720
With more jokes, there goes the reverence.

26:00.740 --> 26:02.440
Without the reverence,

26:02.460 --> 26:05.360
no dignity or respect will be found in people's heart.

26:05.380 --> 26:08.290
Then the tower will collapse, right?

26:08.290 --> 26:11.050
You are ruining our foundation on your own.

26:11.700 --> 26:14.340
Your Majesty, I see.

26:14.340 --> 26:16.250
You don't!

26:20.500 --> 26:22.720
Just think it over.

26:28.100 --> 26:29.370
Come here.

26:31.010 --> 26:34.680
This is the list of officials

26:34.700 --> 26:38.080
to be dismissed these days.

26:38.100 --> 26:39.840
Be prepared for it.

26:39.980 --> 26:42.930
See who are on the list.

26:43.460 --> 26:45.930
Are your followers on it?

26:52.010 --> 26:54.720
I've also been the Crown Prince.

26:55.100 --> 26:58.800
I've fought for what I should.

26:58.820 --> 27:01.720
But there is always a line.

27:03.340 --> 27:04.680
Your Majesty!

27:05.250 --> 27:06.270
Just leave!

27:06.290 --> 27:06.930
Your Majesty!

27:06.930 --> 27:08.200
Leave!

27:42.170 --> 27:43.650
Father!

27:44.220 --> 27:45.650
I'm leaving for studying.

27:46.100 --> 27:47.840
Me, too.

27:50.700 --> 27:52.170
Yes.

27:59.340 --> 28:00.480
Master,

28:00.500 --> 28:01.340
the room for Xian'er

28:01.340 --> 28:03.360
is tidied up.

28:03.380 --> 28:04.500
I'd like to show him around now.

28:04.500 --> 28:05.600
See if he needs anything else.

28:05.620 --> 28:07.170
You may leave first.

28:07.290 --> 28:08.050
I need a word

28:08.050 --> 28:09.840
with him.

28:10.700 --> 28:12.080
Yes.

28:23.460 --> 28:24.750
You're in the capital city now.

28:24.770 --> 28:26.530
Learn to be cautious

28:27.010 --> 28:28.800
later on.

28:28.820 --> 28:30.410
I'm pretty cautious all the time.

28:31.820 --> 28:34.320
How can you call yourself cautious by bring
the assassin of the Investigator's Office

28:34.340 --> 28:36.200
to the capital city.

28:36.890 --> 28:38.390
So you know about Teng Zijing.

28:38.410 --> 28:40.510
The guards escorted you to the capital

28:40.530 --> 28:41.960
are all elites.

28:41.980 --> 28:43.860
You really think they wouldn't notice

28:43.860 --> 28:46.130
when there was one more person.

28:52.250 --> 28:53.080
What's this?

28:53.100 --> 28:54.560
Arrest warrant.

28:54.580 --> 28:56.890
I found it in the files of the Ministry of Penalty.

29:06.170 --> 29:07.840
It's for Teng Zijing.

29:08.130 --> 29:09.270
What crime did he commit?

29:09.290 --> 29:10.990
I don't know, and I don't need to know.

29:11.010 --> 29:12.720
Just be careful of him.

29:16.820 --> 29:18.600
It's an old warrant.

29:18.620 --> 29:20.410
Anyway, he's not here now.

29:21.340 --> 29:23.600
Stay away from the Investigator's Office

29:23.620 --> 29:25.910
in future.

29:25.930 --> 29:27.170
Moreover,

29:28.340 --> 29:30.480
I will make secret investigations to find out

29:30.500 --> 29:31.930
whether the Crown Prince is the one who tried to kill you.

29:31.930 --> 29:34.930
Don't act rashly on your own.

29:35.340 --> 29:37.080
Act rashly?

29:37.250 --> 29:39.010
What can I do?

29:39.100 --> 29:41.770
Can I rush into the Eastern Palace and kill the Crown Prince?

29:43.770 --> 29:45.650
Back then,

29:46.340 --> 29:49.080
your mom could really do that!

29:49.740 --> 29:51.010
So awesome!

29:51.130 --> 29:53.890
She was bound to no rules of the world.

29:54.650 --> 29:56.720
She could always

29:56.980 --> 29:59.010
make unexpected moves.

30:01.860 --> 30:03.290
How did she die?

30:05.010 --> 30:06.530
She was killed.

30:07.010 --> 30:08.680
Those who killed her, are they still alive?

30:08.700 --> 30:09.960
I don't know.

30:09.980 --> 30:11.480
In theory,

30:11.740 --> 30:14.200
the villains who killed your mom

30:14.220 --> 30:17.110
were all wiped out back then,

30:17.130 --> 30:20.560
but Chen Pingping and I both think

30:22.010 --> 30:24.290
there is hidden danger

30:24.580 --> 30:27.080
in the capital city.

30:27.100 --> 30:28.650
So,

30:29.250 --> 30:31.530
I've always kept you in Danzhou.

30:37.100 --> 30:38.270
Eventually,

30:38.290 --> 30:39.990
you still take me to the capital city.

30:40.010 --> 30:41.250
I've told you.

30:41.380 --> 30:43.460
It's the best chance to get back

30:43.460 --> 30:45.250
your mom's properties.

30:45.650 --> 30:46.630
You're right.

30:46.650 --> 30:47.800
Well.

30:47.820 --> 30:50.680
You're also tired. Have a good rest.

30:56.460 --> 30:58.680
As to your marriage with Lin Wan'er,

30:58.820 --> 30:59.980
I'll arrange everything for you.

30:59.980 --> 31:01.840
No need to worry about anything.

31:01.980 --> 31:03.290
I don't want to marry her.

31:05.460 --> 31:06.390
What did you say?

31:06.410 --> 31:07.650
I said

31:07.890 --> 31:10.080
I didn't want to marry Lin Wan'er.

31:10.100 --> 31:12.390
I've said so much,

31:12.410 --> 31:13.820
but you still don't get it?

31:13.820 --> 31:15.410
I get it.

31:16.220 --> 31:18.080
My mom used to have a firm.

31:18.100 --> 31:18.700
Now it belongs to

31:18.700 --> 31:20.480
the imperial family.

31:20.650 --> 31:21.820
By marrying Lin Wan'er,

31:21.820 --> 31:22.990
I can take the firm back.

31:23.010 --> 31:24.390
Now is the perfect chance.

31:24.410 --> 31:26.380
I understand all the things you've said.

31:26.380 --> 31:28.080
I just don't want to marry her.

31:28.100 --> 31:29.270
Why?

31:29.290 --> 31:29.930
I'm falling in love with

31:29.930 --> 31:31.560
a drumstick thief.

31:31.580 --> 31:32.770
What?

31:33.220 --> 31:35.270
Actually, it has nothing to do with her.

31:35.290 --> 31:36.930
Even if I hadn't met her,

31:36.930 --> 31:38.890
I still won't marry Lin Wan'er.

31:39.010 --> 31:40.110
Neiku is the fruit of

31:40.130 --> 31:42.250
your mom's painstaking labor for a lifetime.

31:42.250 --> 31:45.320
I understand it's very important to you.

31:48.700 --> 31:49.750
But...

31:49.770 --> 31:50.800
But how can I

31:50.820 --> 31:52.600
put this?

31:56.770 --> 31:58.770
Look!

32:00.380 --> 32:01.800
It can move.

32:04.100 --> 32:05.960
If cut open, it'll bleed.

32:06.620 --> 32:07.990
I'm growing up recently,

32:08.010 --> 32:09.600
so I eat a lot every day.

32:10.050 --> 32:11.170
Vegetables are good for health,

32:11.170 --> 32:13.010
but I still love to eat meat.

32:13.170 --> 32:13.890
Eating too much meat,

32:13.890 --> 32:14.750
my nose will bleed,

32:14.770 --> 32:15.750
and my nails will grow fast,

32:15.770 --> 32:17.080
so I often have to cut them every day.

32:17.100 --> 32:18.680
What nonsense are you talking about?

32:18.700 --> 32:21.200
I'm telling you that I am a man.

32:21.620 --> 32:23.230
Not a chess piece.

32:23.250 --> 32:25.130
Not a chip.

32:25.410 --> 32:27.390
I am a living man.

32:27.410 --> 32:28.580
Why would I

32:28.580 --> 32:29.930
use my life

32:29.930 --> 32:32.370
to trade for a firm?

32:34.580 --> 32:36.530
Xian'er, you have to understand.

32:37.170 --> 32:39.530
If you control Neiku,

32:40.580 --> 32:42.410
you're in control of

32:42.860 --> 32:44.930
uncounted wealth.

32:44.930 --> 32:46.770
Were you with my mom

32:46.770 --> 32:48.080
for her money?

32:48.100 --> 32:49.560
How dare you!

33:00.740 --> 33:02.250
I can't marry her.

33:03.460 --> 33:05.010
I want to live

33:05.620 --> 33:07.890
for myself.

33:13.100 --> 33:15.050
These are all your followers.

33:15.530 --> 33:17.680
His Majesty is warning me.

33:17.980 --> 33:20.050
It's a warning and a guide.

33:20.100 --> 33:21.250
Officials on the list

33:21.250 --> 33:23.200
are all from Ministry of War and Ministry of Personnel.

33:23.220 --> 33:24.720
See it yourself!

33:26.580 --> 33:29.080
His Majesty wants to tell you

33:29.130 --> 33:32.250
the line is military power and official governance.

33:32.500 --> 33:34.170
As long as you don't cross the line,

33:34.220 --> 33:35.380
you can do

33:35.380 --> 33:37.370
whatever you want.

33:37.980 --> 33:39.080
If that's true,

33:39.100 --> 33:40.720
then I can take Neiku by force.

33:41.250 --> 33:42.500
His Majesty just said

33:42.500 --> 33:44.130
we had adopted the wrong means,

33:44.700 --> 33:46.650
but he didn't say

33:46.700 --> 33:48.800
we can't go after Fan Xian.

33:49.100 --> 33:50.410
Aunt,

33:50.500 --> 33:52.010
what should we do?

33:54.700 --> 33:56.530
Why did His Majesty choose Fan Xian

33:56.530 --> 33:58.320
to compete for the financial power of Neiku?

33:58.930 --> 34:00.200
He has never been to the capital city

34:00.220 --> 34:01.560
and he belongs to no factions.

34:01.580 --> 34:02.800
He's not the only one.

34:02.820 --> 34:04.840
But why him?

34:06.050 --> 34:07.890
Rumor has it that

34:08.380 --> 34:10.370
Fan Xian has written

34:10.580 --> 34:12.490
a masterpiece named Red Mansions

34:12.580 --> 34:14.130
under a pseudonym.

34:16.620 --> 34:18.560
I was wrong before.

34:19.290 --> 34:21.170
To destroy him completely,

34:21.450 --> 34:22.120
we must aim at

34:22.140 --> 34:24.320
what he's best known for.

34:25.210 --> 34:26.650
Red Mansions.

35:03.050 --> 35:04.280
Young Master.

35:04.940 --> 35:06.170
Young Master.

35:06.530 --> 35:07.510
Give it to me!

35:07.530 --> 35:08.340
Give me!

35:08.340 --> 35:09.560
Give me that!

35:12.970 --> 35:13.690
Just put it down.

35:13.690 --> 35:15.120
Put it down! Put it down!

35:15.140 --> 35:16.370
I don't need these.

35:17.420 --> 35:18.750
All of you, just go back.

35:18.770 --> 35:19.600
Young Master,

35:19.620 --> 35:20.140
we are the servants

35:20.140 --> 35:21.580
of your yard now.

35:21.580 --> 35:23.490
Where else can we go?

35:25.690 --> 35:26.470
You...

35:26.490 --> 35:28.670
Look at me!

35:28.690 --> 35:29.990
Healthy and strong as I am,

35:30.010 --> 35:31.840
I don't need any servant.

35:32.100 --> 35:32.920
In addition,

35:32.940 --> 35:33.840
as men, we are born equal.

35:33.860 --> 35:35.400
No one is superior and no one is inferior.

35:35.420 --> 35:36.730
We are all the same.

35:37.140 --> 35:39.730
You should also live for yourselves.

35:40.620 --> 35:41.890
Just go.

35:46.530 --> 35:47.800
What are you doing?

35:47.820 --> 35:48.450
Young Master.

35:48.450 --> 35:49.820
We are servants.

35:49.820 --> 35:51.080
If we did anything wrong,

35:51.100 --> 35:52.450
please punish us directly.

35:52.450 --> 35:53.530
Just don't scare us.

35:53.530 --> 35:54.100
Right, Young Master.

35:54.100 --> 35:55.670
How am I scaring you?

35:55.690 --> 35:56.820
I'm serious

35:56.820 --> 35:57.880
about that.

35:57.900 --> 35:58.710
Moreover,

35:58.730 --> 36:00.710
stop calling yourselves servants.

36:00.730 --> 36:01.860
We are

36:01.860 --> 36:03.360
all equal.

36:03.380 --> 36:05.270
Everyone is his own master.

36:05.290 --> 36:06.080
Young Master,

36:06.100 --> 36:07.940
life or death, we belong to the Fan family.

36:07.940 --> 36:09.510
We're absolutely loyal!

36:09.530 --> 36:11.490
We're absolutely loyal!

36:20.340 --> 36:21.190
Apparently,

36:21.210 --> 36:21.940
debating

36:21.940 --> 36:23.450
based on different knowledge levels

36:23.450 --> 36:25.450
is by itself unequal.

36:25.490 --> 36:27.180
Personnel management is an art.

36:27.180 --> 36:27.900
Sometimes,

36:27.900 --> 36:30.130
you have to be simple and rough.

36:31.770 --> 36:34.040
Just fuck off!

36:34.620 --> 36:35.840
I'm unsociable and eccentric.

36:35.860 --> 36:37.290
I don't want to see others in my yard.

36:37.290 --> 36:38.750
Hurry up and leave!

36:38.770 --> 36:40.600
Leave! Mind your own business!

36:40.620 --> 36:41.270
Young Master,

36:41.290 --> 36:41.860
if...

36:41.860 --> 36:43.080
if you said that earlier,

36:43.100 --> 36:44.450
we would understand you.

36:44.450 --> 36:46.560
Then why are you still here?

36:46.690 --> 36:48.190
Yes, Young Master!

36:48.210 --> 36:49.180
We'll leave now.

36:49.180 --> 36:49.770
Whatever you need,

36:49.770 --> 36:50.730
just tell us.

36:50.730 --> 36:51.180
Leave right away!

36:51.180 --> 36:52.710
Or I'll beat you with a plank.

36:52.730 --> 36:53.670
Yes, Young Master.

36:53.690 --> 36:54.420
You guys!

36:54.420 --> 36:55.770
Hurry back and find a plank

36:55.770 --> 36:56.620
for Young Master.

36:56.620 --> 36:58.280
-Yes. -Fuck off!

37:13.340 --> 37:14.580
Young Master, you've had a long day.

37:14.580 --> 37:15.530
Please rest early.

37:15.530 --> 37:16.250
If he lives alone,

37:16.250 --> 37:17.690
who shall take care of his daily life.

37:17.690 --> 37:18.340
Fine! Fine!

37:18.340 --> 37:19.450
There are so many

37:19.450 --> 37:20.210
weird young masters and ladies

37:20.210 --> 37:20.880
in different families.

37:20.900 --> 37:21.820
It's no big deal.

37:21.820 --> 37:23.340
Only what he said first

37:23.340 --> 37:24.100
sounds horrifying.

37:24.100 --> 37:24.800
Enough! Enough!

37:24.820 --> 37:26.750
You guys, listen to me!

37:26.770 --> 37:28.430
It's not that bad.

37:28.450 --> 37:30.140
He was much nicer

37:30.140 --> 37:31.050
when he asked for a plank for beating us.

37:31.050 --> 37:32.840
Right!

38:31.530 --> 38:34.890
Fan Xian! Fan Xian!

38:36.770 --> 38:38.170
Fan Xian.

38:38.620 --> 38:40.040
Are you asleep?

38:40.660 --> 38:41.450
It's Fan Sizhe.

38:41.450 --> 38:42.840
I need to talk to you.

38:43.970 --> 38:45.370
I'm coming in.

38:48.530 --> 38:49.890
Sleeping already?

38:51.140 --> 38:52.450
Wake up!

38:53.970 --> 38:55.230
Don't sleep!

38:55.250 --> 38:56.560
I have something to tell you.

38:57.250 --> 38:58.750
How come you sleep like a log?

38:58.770 --> 39:01.760
Fan Xian! Wake up!

39:03.290 --> 39:04.270
Fan Xian,

39:04.290 --> 39:06.520
haven't you slept in Danzhou?

39:23.530 --> 39:25.040
Are you awake?

39:26.100 --> 39:27.950
I have something to tell you.

39:27.970 --> 39:30.340
Well, today,

39:30.340 --> 39:31.800
I almost beat you.

39:31.820 --> 39:32.920
It's my fault.

39:32.940 --> 39:34.100
After all, we are relatives,

39:34.100 --> 39:34.820
right?

39:34.820 --> 39:35.880
How about this?

39:35.900 --> 39:37.730
I'll book a table in a restaurant

39:37.730 --> 39:39.340
at noon tomorrow.

39:39.340 --> 39:40.770
Take it as my apology for you.

39:40.770 --> 39:42.130
Is that OK?

39:44.490 --> 39:46.670
Well, I'll take that as a “Yes”.

39:46.690 --> 39:48.730
At noon tomorrow. Don't forget!

39:50.340 --> 39:51.400
I'm leaving.

39:51.420 --> 39:52.970
I'll leave this on your desk.

40:27.940 --> 40:29.560
Fan Xian.

40:44.770 --> 40:46.060
Who is he?

40:46.080 --> 40:46.440
Teng Zijing, member of the Fourth Division
of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing

40:46.450 --> 40:47.690
What?

40:48.250 --> 40:50.130
He's the guard who escorted me to the capital city.

40:54.900 --> 40:56.600
Sending away all the maidservants

40:56.620 --> 40:58.520
while keeping a guard,

40:59.580 --> 41:01.080
what's wrong with you?

41:02.620 --> 41:04.170
Why are you here?

41:06.140 --> 41:07.320
There's one more thing.

41:07.340 --> 41:08.670
Dad

41:08.690 --> 41:09.950
is old-fashioned and inflexible.

41:09.970 --> 41:11.450
But no matter what,

41:11.450 --> 41:12.880
he's still your dad.

41:12.900 --> 41:13.920
Do you understand?

41:13.940 --> 41:15.560
I don't need you to tell me that.

41:15.580 --> 41:16.840
Fine! Fine! Fine!

41:19.340 --> 41:20.730
Don't tell him about

41:20.730 --> 41:21.750
our lunch tomorrow.

41:21.770 --> 41:23.080
I see.

41:24.290 --> 41:25.760
I'll leave you to your business.

41:31.140 --> 41:32.840
Where were you just now?

41:35.970 --> 41:37.690
Anywhere you can't see.

41:43.100 --> 41:44.520
Aren't you gone?

42:00.450 --> 42:01.930
Listen.

42:02.250 --> 42:03.470
He has fallen into my trap.

42:03.490 --> 42:04.490
Tomorrow morning,

42:04.490 --> 42:06.800
find some guys to go out with me.

42:06.820 --> 42:08.140
I will beat up

42:08.140 --> 42:09.880
the bumpkin from Danzhou.

42:09.900 --> 42:11.840
He is a Young Master of the family after all.

42:11.860 --> 42:13.030
He is a Young Master.

42:13.050 --> 42:14.800
I'm not, right?

42:14.940 --> 42:15.670
Fuck off!

42:15.690 --> 42:16.840
Yes.

42:17.770 --> 42:19.400
All your files back then

42:19.420 --> 42:21.760
were transferred by the Investigator's Office.

42:24.420 --> 42:26.080
The only thing left

42:33.100 --> 42:35.840
is this arrest warrant.

42:38.770 --> 42:40.190
According to it,

42:40.210 --> 42:41.920
the crime you committed back then

42:41.940 --> 42:44.280
was assassinating court officials.

42:46.450 --> 42:48.120
This is weird.

42:48.140 --> 42:49.530
Why would the Investigator's Office

42:49.530 --> 42:51.320
hire a criminal

42:51.340 --> 42:52.970
like you?

43:16.400 --> 43:19.980
In the river of history,

43:20.000 --> 43:23.470
time goes round and round.

43:26.280 --> 43:29.620
Memories about the former and present lives

43:29.640 --> 43:33.710
join each other in an endless way.

43:35.600 --> 43:38.220
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:38.240 --> 43:40.480
one season follows another in a flash,

43:40.480 --> 43:42.980
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:43.000 --> 43:44.600
I just can't give up

43:44.600 --> 43:47.940
to be with you for my whole life.

43:47.960 --> 43:53.430
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:54.680 --> 43:57.230
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:57.520 --> 43:59.560
Year after year in the wandering,

43:59.560 --> 44:02.220
I count the remaining years.

44:02.240 --> 44:04.420
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:04.440 --> 44:06.430
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:06.720 --> 44:09.110
I never feel regretful.

44:09.160 --> 44:10.520
In such a chaotic world,

44:10.520 --> 44:13.500
I still miss you as ever.

44:13.520 --> 44:16.470
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:16.760 --> 44:18.820
With a gentle heart,

44:18.840 --> 44:21.500
I cherish our remaining years.

44:21.520 --> 44:23.040
Even though we have to go through

44:23.040 --> 44:25.550
all the hardships along the journey,

44:25.680 --> 44:32.870
you always stay by my side,

44:32.960 --> 44:35.630
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:35.920 --> 44:38.000
Year after year in the wandering,

44:38.000 --> 44:40.660
I count the remaining years.

44:40.680 --> 44:42.820
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:42.840 --> 44:45.070
even though we end up the destiny,

44:45.280 --> 44:47.460
I never feel regretful.

44:47.480 --> 44:48.880
In such a chaotic world,

44:48.880 --> 44:51.940
I still miss you as ever.

44:51.960 --> 44:55.070
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:55.160 --> 44:57.300
With a gentle heart,

44:57.320 --> 45:00.020
I cherish our remaining years.

45:00.040 --> 45:01.480
Even though we have to go through

45:01.480 --> 45:04.140
all the hardships along the journey,

45:04.160 --> 45:12.920
you always stay by my side...
